      "value": "It’s so inaccurate! I had a friend that I had literally seen in game the day before and it said he hadn’t been on in like 2 months.... lol \n\nSo this is definitely a feature that needs fixing. It was something I was excited for (especially for cleaning up my friends list of people who haven't been on in a long time), but it’s so inaccurate that you can’t trust it",
