  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, I was just playing vrchat with a friend and sometimes I will log in to my account on my pc to look at various things I can’t see on the actual game. My friend had just logged off of the game and I went to my browser and logged into my account and happened to notice that it said they had been offline for two hours. That wasn’t correct because they had just signed off 2 minutes ago. I refreshed the page and it still said the same thing. It would be nice if the times shown on the website were accurate when friends are or have gone offline\n \nThank you!",
